docs {
  # getGatewayUptime

  Get the runtime counter of the gateway (uptime) in seconds.

  ## Required service level

  `none`

  ## Body

  `none`

  ## Response

  `200 OK`

  - `Value`: integer (uint32)

  ### Example

  ```json
  {
	"Value": 123456
  }
  ```
}

